    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "[CRLMP-9150/2025] This Court has considered the FIR registered against the petitioners as well as has gone through the factual report dated 19.01.2026 submitted by learned Public Prosecutor.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1549,
      "end": 1739,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CRLMP-9150/2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1550,
          "end": 1565
        },
        {
          "text": "19.01.2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1689,
          "end": 1699
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The case involves availing of KCC limits by agriculturists on the basis of forged documents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1740,
      "end": 1833,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Kunanaram vs State Of Rajasthan (2026:Rj-Jd:14481) on 27 March, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/158174561/\n1",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1834,
      "end": 1960,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kunanaram vs State Of Rajasthan (2026:Rj-Jd:14481)",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1835,
          "end": 1885
        },
        {
          "text": "27 March, 2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1889,
          "end": 1903
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "KCC limit is given to farmers for the purpose of crops but, however, as the FIR reveals, the limits were created on the basis of forged documents of land.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1961,
      "end": 2115,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5123189687728882
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Forged survey reports were prepared and loan was availed, which apparently discloses fraud upon the public money.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2116,
      "end": 2229,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5976287722587585
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The petitioners in this case are persons who have availed KCC limits and their assertion that they are not involved in the case, is absolutely untenable, as loan has been taken by them upon execution of the documents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2230,
      "end": 2448,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6200036406517029
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The petitioners have clearly participated in preparation of the forged documents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2449,
      "end": 2531,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6496452689170837
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The investigation of police shows involvement of the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2532,
      "end": 2597,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6476046442985535
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "In view of the same, the FIR prima facie discloses commission of cognizable offence and hence, there is no ground for quashing of FIR registered against the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2598,
      "end": 2767,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6619238257408142
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Therefore, the criminal misc. petition being devoid of any merit is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2768,
      "end": 2846,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5421350598335266
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Stay application and all pending applications, if any, stands disposed of accordingly.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2847,
      "end": 2934,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15109194815158844
